OL,3,GNEWSAOld buildings across South West to
OL,4,Aget #5m boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of historical buildings and
OL,7,Fchurches across the South West are set
OL,8,Fto benefit from repair and renovation
OL,9,Fas part of a #5million funding boost.
OL,11,FA total of 17 heritage buildings and
OL,12,Flisted places of worship in the South
OL,13,FWest will receive the support from
OL,14,FHistoric England's Places of Worship
OL,15,FRenewal Fund and the Heritage at Risk
OL,16,FCapital Funds.
OL,18,FThey include the Church of St Elwyn in
OL,19,FHayle, Cornwall, the Church of St
OL,20,FMatthias in Plymouth and the vacant
OL,21,FGrade II-listed Oldway Mansion in
OL,22,FTorbay.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
