OL,3,GNEWSAOld buildings across South West to
OL,4,Aget #5m boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeritage Minister Baroness Twycross
OL,7,Fsaid the funding meant buildings "that
OL,8,Ffill our hometowns with character will
OL,9,Fbe keeping the doors open to
OL,10,Fcommunities for years to come".
